From 7afbcbaf6e0bd3ab79c173fa77c119ad4a1b0c08 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Quintin Smits <qd.smits@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 17:04:10 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(machine): record the installed control and tool-change
 procedure

Keep the control model, NC software and installed options with the machine. Preserve them through the project file, machine sheet and post interface. Add the manual-change Fehlmann Picomax 55 installation.

Refs #3098

Co-Authored-By: Codex <codex@openai.com>

Fixes #3181
